    <div class="board-note">{{ t('≥3 distinct officer/director buyers within the window — clusters are rarer and less plan-driven than single buys. Descriptive, not a signal.','窗口期内≥3名不同高管/董事买入——集群买入比单人买入更罕见、更少出于预设计划。描述性数据，并非信号。') }}</div>
